# Google OAuth client ID (Web application) — same value as the server's
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID. Create one at:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# The "Sign in with Google" button only renders when this is set AND the
# server reports Google auth available.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Google AdSense (optional). Until VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT is set, no ad code
# loads and ad slots render nothing. Get these from the AdSense dashboard:
# your publisher id (ca-pub-…) and one display ad unit id per placement.
# The server's ADSENSE_PUBLISHER_ID serves /ads.txt.
VITE_ADSENSE_CLIENT=
VITE_ADSENSE_SLOT_TIMER=
VITE_ADSENSE_SLOT_COMPETITIONS=
VITE_ADSENSE_SLOT_RESULTS=
VITE_ADSENSE_SLOT_FOOTER=
